o has a broken foot or a broken hand,"},{"n":20,"text":"Or a hunchback or a dwarf, or one who has a defect in his eye or eczema or scale or crushed testicles.","tok":[{"t":"Or a "},{"t":"hunchback","s":["H1384"],"a":[1]},{"t":" or a "},{"t":"dwarf","s":["H1851"],"a":[3]},{"t":", or one who has a defect in his "},{"t":"eye","s":["H5869"],"a":[6]},{"t":" or eczema or scale or crushed testicles."}]},{"n":21,"text":"No one of the seed of Aaron the priest who has a defect shall come near to present Jehovah’s offerings by fire. He has a defect; he shall not come near to present the food of his God.","tok":[{"t":"No one of the "},{"t":"seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Aaron","s":["H0175"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[7]},{"t":" who has a defect shall come "},{"t":"near","s":["H5066"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to present Jehovah’s "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H0801"],"a":[12]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0801"]},{"t":". He has a defect; he shall not come "},{"t":"near","s":["H5066"],"a":[20]},{"t":" to present the food of his "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":22,"text":"He may eat the food of his God, both of the most holy and of the holy,","tok":[{"t":"He may "},{"t":"eat","s":["H0398"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the food of his "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":", both of the "},{"t":"most","s":["H6944"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6944"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and of the "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6944"],"a":[5]},{"t":","}]},{"n":23,"text":"But he shall not go in unto the veil or come near to the altar, because he has a defect, so that he does not profane My holy places; for I am Jehovah who sanctifies them.","tok":[{"t":"But he shall not go "},{"t":"in","s":["H0935"],"a":[4]},{"t":" unto the veil or come "},{"t":"near","s":["H5066"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"altar","s":["H4196"],"a":[6]},{"t":", because he has a defect, so that he does not "},{"t":"profane","s":["H2490"],"a":[13]},{"t":" My holy places; for I am "},